  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Hi all，&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">【福马迎春送财运】活动已于2月16日上线</span>，现申请春节年后累计打卡玩法主播映币奖励下发。</p><p><br /></p><p>今日申请下发映币奖励共<strong>778841映币</strong>，折合人民币<strong>31153.64元</strong>，下发人数<strong>811人</strong><strong>。</strong></p><p>辛苦@叶导 确认审批，</p><p>辛苦@成武 确认核对。</p><p><br /></p><p><strong>具体奖励领取情况如下：</strong></p><p><strong>整体数据：</strong></p><p>【实际】春节年中全勤打卡玩法获得映币奖励的主播共计<strong>811</strong><strong>人</strong>，合计获得映币奖励<strong>778841</strong><strong>映币</strong>，折合人民币<strong>31153.64</strong><strong>元。</strong></p><p>【预期】预期日均覆盖<strong>448人</strong>，合计获得映币奖励<strong>822508映币</strong>，折合人民币<strong>32900元</strong>。</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 32.8054%;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col style=\"width: 17.1064%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 18.6758%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 10.0441%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 15.8509%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 18.205%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 19.9313%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>可解锁比例</td><td>打卡天数</td><td>人数</td><td>存金库</td><td>可结算收益</td><td>可结算人民币</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"2\">10%</td><td>1</td><td>73</td><td>9087</td><td>843</td><td>33.72</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>2</td><td>77</td><td>18046</td><td>1739</td><td>69.56</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"2\">30%</td><td>3</td><td>79</td><td>43648</td><td>13073</td><td>522.92</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>4</td><td>73</td><td>46176</td><td>13815</td><td>552.6</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"2\">70%</td><td>5</td><td>92</td><td>60386</td><td>42229</td><td>1689.16</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>6</td><td>94</td><td>104843</td><td>73331</td><td>2933.24</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"2\">100%</td><td>7</td><td>116</td><td>163733</td><td>163733</td><td>6549.32</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>8</td><td>207</td><td>470078</td><td>470078</td><td>18803.12</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><br /></td><td>总计</td><td>811</td><td>915997</td><td>778841</td><td>31153.64</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><span>以上，如有问题随时沟通。</span></p><p>感谢。</p>",
